    "html": "<section class=\"lu-claro\" style=\"background:#FFFFFF;color:#151515;--rosa:#C8661F;--paper:#151515;--muted:#8A8580;--soft:#4A4744;--g1:#F4F1EC;--line:#E7E2DB\"><style>.pm .pm-lienzo .lu-claro .pm-card-r,.pm .pm-lienzo .lu-claro .pill-r{background:#FFC48F}.pm .pm-lienzo .lu-claro .pm-card{box-shadow:0 2px 14px rgba(0,0,0,.04)}</style><style>@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@500;600;700&display=swap');</style><p class=\"abs a pm-eyebrow\" style=\"left:128px;top:128px;--d:0\">Guion 17 de 19 · Lifestyle + humor</p><div class=\"abs a\" style=\"left:128px;top:166px;padding:4px 14px;border-radius:999px;background:#3E6FA8;color:#151515;font-size:16px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;--d:0\">Atraer</div><p class=\"abs a muted\" style=\"left:300px;top:168px;width:1250px;font-size:20px;line-height:1.4;--d:0\">Serie: ¿Te ha pasado? · Objetivo: <b>Envíos</b> · Dónde: <b>Salón de la chimenea</b></p><div class=\"abs a\" style=\"left:128px;top:230px;width:1400px;--d:1\"><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:19px;line-height:1.38;color:#151515\"><tr><th style=\"text-align:left;padding:0 18px 10px 12px;font-size:15px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#C8661F;width:11%\">Plano</th><th style=\"text-align:left;padding:0 18px 10px 12px;font-size:15px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#C8661F;width:27%\">Qué se ve</th><th style=\"text-align:left;padding:0 18px 10px 12px;font-size:15px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#C8661F;width:38%\">Qué dices</th><th style=\"text-align:left;padding:0 18px 10px 12px;font-size:15px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#C8661F;width:24%\">Texto en pantalla</th></tr><tr style=\"background:#DDF1E4;border-bottom:1px solid #EEEAE4;border-left:6px solid #DDF1E4;\"><td style=\"padding:12px 18px 12px 12px;vertical-align:top;font-weight:800;white-space:nowrap\">Plano 1<br><span style='font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#2F7A50'>HOOK</span></td><td style=\"padding:12px 18px 12px 12px;vertical-align:top\">Te preparas: cascos, esterilla, mancuernas. Música épica en edición.</td><td style=\"padding:12px 18px 12px 12px;vertical-align:top\"><span style=\"color:#8A8580;font-weight:400\">Sin voz: música + texto en pantalla</span></td><td style=\"padding:12px 12px 12px 12px;vertical-align:top;color:#8A8580;font-style:italic\">Se encarga Jandro en edición</td></tr><tr style=\"background:transparent;border-bottom:1px solid #EEEAE4;border-left:6px solid #FFFFFF;\"><td style=\"padding:12px 18px 12px 12px;vertical-align:top;font-weight:800;white-space:nowrap\">Plano 2</td><td style=\"padding:12px 18px 12px 12px;vertical-align:top\">De fondo, una voz de niño.</td><td style=\"padding:12px 18px 12px 12px;vertical-align:top\">(Fuera de plano) «¡MAMIIII!»</td><td style=\"padding:12px 12px 12px 12px;vertical-align:top;color:#8A8580;font-style:italic\">Se encarga Jandro en edición</td></tr><tr style=\"background:transparent;border-bottom:1px solid #EEEAE4;border-left:6px solid #FFFFFF;\"><td style=\"padding:12px 18px 12px 12px;vertical-align:top;font-weight:800;white-space:nowrap\">Plano 3</td><td style=\"padding:12px 18px 12px 12px;vertical-align:top\">Dejas las mancuernas, miras a cámara con resignación… y gritas.</td><td style=\"padding:12px 18px 12px 12px;vertical-align:top\">«¡PAPIIII!» Y sigues entrenando.</td><td style=\"padding:12px 12px 12px 12px;vertical-align:top;color:#8A8580;font-style:italic\">Se encarga Jandro en edición</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#DCE7F8;border-bottom:1px solid #EEEAE4;border-left:6px solid #DCE7F8;\"><td style=\"padding:12px 18px 12px 12px;vertical-align:top;font-weight:800;white-space:nowrap\">Cierre<br><span style='font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#2D5BA8'>CTA</span></td><td style=\"padding:12px 18px 12px 12px;vertical-align:top\">—</td><td style=\"padding:12px 18px 12px 12px;vertical-align:top\">Sin petición: el chiste se envía solo. Si acaso, texto final «Etiqueta a otra madre».</td><td style=\"padding:12px 12px 12px 12px;vertical-align:top;color:#8A8580;font-style:italic\">Se encarga Jandro en edición</td></tr></table></div><div class=\"abs pop\" style=\"left:1592px;top:128px;width:200px;height:356px;border-radius:20px;overflow:hidden;background:#ddd url(/pitch/level-up/portadas-src/g17.jpg) center/cover no-repeat;box-shadow:0 16px 40px rgba(21,31,48,.18);--d:1\"><div style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;background:rgba(21,31,48,.18)\"></div><div style=\"position:absolute;left:16px;right:16px;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);text-align:center;font-family:'Poppins',sans-serif;text-shadow:0 2px 16px rgba(0,0,0,.55);color:#fff\"><div style=\"font-size:7px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;opacity:.9\">¿Te ha pasado?</div><div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.08;margin-top:6px\">Mis 20 minutos</div></div></div><p class=\"abs a muted\" style=\"left:1592px;top:492px;width:200px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.4;text-align:center;--d:1\">Portada</p><div class=\"abs pop\" style=\"left:1592px;top:540px;width:200px;height:130px;border-radius:12px;background:#ddd url(/pitch/level-up/casa/salon.jpg) center/cover no-repeat;--d:2\"></div><p class=\"abs a soft\" style=\"left:1592px;top:682px;width:200px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.4;line-height:1.35;--d:2\">Alfombra del salón de la chimenea, con los juguetes alrededor.</p><p class=\"abs a muted\" style=\"left:128px;top:930px;width:1400px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.4;line-height:1.4;--d:3\"><b style='color:#C8661F;letter-spacing:.1em;font-size:14px'>DESCRIPCIÓN</b>&nbsp;&nbsp;Cuando por fin tienes 20 minutos para entrenar… Madres que entrenan, esto va por vosotras.</p><div class=\"foot\" style=\"left:128px;\"><span>Maen Studios × Level Up Workout</span><span class=\"n\">18</span></div></section>"
